@comment{
  Selected Publications — Thi Ngoc Trang Tran

  Single source of truth for the .pub cards rendered on publications.html
  (full year-grouped list) and index.html (Featured Publications block,
  filtered to entries with featured = true).

  Custom non-standard fields (consumed by _layouts/pub_card.html):
    selected    = "true" if the entry should appear on publications.html.
                  Set to "false" (or remove the field) to hide an entry
                  without deleting it.
    featured    = "true" if the entry should also appear on index.html
                  Featured Publications block (subset of selected).
    rank        = ranking tag rendered to the right of the venue line
                  (e.g. CORE A*, CORE A, CORE B, SCIMAGO Q2). Optional.
    month       = numeric (1-12) — within-year sort key, descending.
    html_venue  = pre-rendered HTML for the venue line. Used instead of
                  auto-building from booktitle/journal/series/volume/
                  number/publisher because the venue format varies a lot
                  across CEUR / FAIA / LNNS / SCI / AAAI / SPLC / VaMoS
                  / Software Impacts — no single rule handles all cases.

  Authors render via Liquid in the template: it splits entry.author on
  " and ", normalizes "Last, First" -> "First Last", and wraps
  "Thi Ngoc Trang Tran" in <strong>. No author_html field needed.
}

